{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-35862","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-40097","text":"Agentelic Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35864","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40098","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build agents like software. Spec-driven. Tested. Deployed."}]}],"id":"blk-35863","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35866","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40099","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-40100","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-40101","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-40102","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-40103","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-40104","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-40105","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-35865","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-35867","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40106","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-40107","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"},{"id":"spn-40108","text":" — a premium, enterprise-grade agent builder that brings software engineering discipline to AI agent development."}]},{"id":"blk-35868","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40109","text":"Agentelic targets the engineering teams that need to ship reliable agents to production — with versioned specs, deterministic testing, staged rollouts, and compliance gates. While the market is flooded with no-code agent builders optimized for demos, Agentelic is optimized for production."}]},{"id":"blk-35869","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40110","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-35870","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-40111","text":"What Agentelic Does"}]},{"id":"blk-35871","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40112","text":"Agentelic is the "},{"id":"spn-40113","marks":["bold"],"text":"engineering layer"},{"id":"spn-40114","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem:"}]},{"id":"blk-35872","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (Standards)    → defines agent behavior as versioned specs\n    ↓\nAgentelic (Engineering)   → builds, tests, deploys agents against specs  ← THIS\n    ↓\nOpenSentience (Runtime)   → governs, executes, observes agents locally\n    ↓\nGraphonomous (Memory)     → continual learning knowledge graphs\n    ↓\nFleetPrompt (Distribution) · Delegatic (Orchestration)"},{"id":"blk-35873","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40115","marks":["bold"],"text":"Key capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-35874","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40116","marks":["bold"],"text":"Spec-driven builds"},{"id":"spn-40117","text":" — Every agent starts from a SpecPrompt specification."}]}],"id":"blk-35875","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35877","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40118","text":"Parse, generate, compile, and package in one pipeline."}]},{"id":"blk-35878","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35880","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40119","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deterministic testing"},{"id":"spn-40120","text":" — Tests are derived from acceptance criteria, not"}]}],"id":"blk-35879","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35881","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40121","text":"hand-written. Mocked tool calls, output validation, regression suites."}]},{"id":"blk-35882","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40122","marks":["bold"],"text":"Staged deployment"},{"id":"spn-40123","text":" — Staging → canary → production with permission review"}]}],"id":"blk-35883","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35885","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40124","text":"gates and compliance checks."}]},{"id":"blk-35886","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35888","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40125","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool surface"},{"id":"spn-40126","text":" — The entire build pipeline is exposed as MCP tools for"}]}],"id":"blk-35887","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35889","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40127","text":"AI-assisted agent development."}]},{"id":"blk-35890","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-40128","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-35891","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-40129","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-35892","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-35893","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-35894","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: Agentelic Docs\n\nspec/README"},{"id":"blk-35895","kind":"paragraph","s